inspiration "lisa-gelobter" name="Lisa Gelobter" profile-citation="lisa-gelobter-lemelson" impact-mode="invention" {
    achievement "She was part of the team that created Shockwave, helping establish multimedia and rich interaction as fundamental capabilities of the web."
    impact-fit "Gelobter creates impact by turning emerging technical capabilities into new product forms, including the interactive multimedia experiences enabled by Shockwave."
    appearance "velocity-new-york-2015" title="Technology for public good" event="O'Reilly Velocity New York" year="2015" format="keynote" {
        summary """
            Gelobter discusses public-interest technology through work on digital services, Healthcare.gov, online immigration forms, and the College Scorecard. The talk shifts attention from technology as spectacle to technology as a mechanism for improving consequential public interactions.

